   "subject": "Re: Missing = \"ML\" vs missing = \"FIML\"",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><div>I once heard Bengt Muthen talk about how ML is inherently full information*, and therefore adding &quot;full information&quot; to ML was redundant - at least according to some people. </div><div><br></div><div>Jeremy</div><div><br></div><div>* In, for example, mixed models ML is full information, it would be silly to say FIML</div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
