     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Monday 8 July 2024 at 13:47:53 UTC-4 <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">jeremy...@gmail.com</a> wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><br><div>I once heard Bengt Muthen talk about how ML is inherently full information*, and therefore adding &quot;full information&quot; to ML was redundant - at least according to some people. </div><div><br></div><div>Jeremy</div><div><br></div><div>* In, for example, mixed models ML is full information, it would be silly to say FIML</div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Fri, 5 Jul 2024 at 15:15, Terrence Jorgensen &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">tjorge...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div><blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div>is FIML requested with missing = &quot;FIML&quot; or &quot;ML&quot; or both? </div></blockquote><div><br></div><div>Either.  They are &quot;alias&quot; references to the same method: calculating the (log-)likelihood for the set of variables observed per row of data.</div><div><br></div><div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;line-height:1.2\">Terrence D. Jorgensen </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;line-height:1.2\">   (he, him, his)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;line-height:1.2\"><br>Assistant Professor, Methods and Statistics<br>Research Institute for Child Development and Education, the University of Amsterdam<br><a href=\"https://eur04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Furldefense.com%2Fv3%2F__http%3A%2Fwww.uva.nl%2Fprofile%2Ft.d.jorgensen__%3B!!D9dNQwwGXtA!RdmdUd4WPRh7g7WAPQViCxUMWWjfCFpYPBs_GolbBQ-8m6MZFr9q93hgVEl4SnZ0IqPtX17qKMdVIrknwgORIVJK-9w%24&amp;data=05%...%40uva.nl%7C787cddbcbb304d36cd2808dc896574a6%7Ca0f1cacd618c4403b94576fb3d6874e5%7C0%7C0%7C638536316050859803%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=m0lXbiRM61LU8SlXmHCEAbZGCI%2F39ZSVK%2FOV6SuCMpY%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"Original URL:\r\nhttps://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen__;!!D9dNQwwGXtA!RdmdUd4WPRh7g7WAPQViCxUMWWjfCFpYPBs_GolbBQ-8m6MZFr9q93hgVEl4SnZ0IqPtX17qKMdVIrknwgORIVJK-9w$\r\n\r\nClick to follow link.\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"text-decoration-line:underline;color:rgb(0,120,215)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://eur04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Furldefense.com%252Fv3%252F__http%253A%252Fwww.uva.nl%252Fprofile%252Ft.d.jorgensen__%253B!!D9dNQwwGXtA!RdmdUd4WPRh7g7WAPQViCxUMWWjfCFpYPBs_GolbBQ-8m6MZFr9q93hgVEl4SnZ0IqPtX17qKMdVIrknwgORIVJK-9w%2524%26data%3D05%257C02%257CT.D.Jorgensen%2540uva.nl%257C787cddbcbb304d36cd2808dc896574a6%257Ca0f1cacd618c4403b94576fb3d6874e5%257C0%257C0%257C638536316050859803%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%253D%257C0%257C%257C%257C%26sdata%3Dm0lXbiRM61LU8SlXmHCEAbZGCI%252F39ZSVK%252FOV6SuCMpY%253D%26reserved%3D0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792414418136000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Fajeh1W6DCAMHGQV3GW9w\"><span style=\"color:rgb(5,99,193)\">http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen</span></a></span><br></div><div><br style=\"color:rgb(80,0,80)\"></div></div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\